        "Free Tier: turn on AWS Config for one Region recording only S3 buckets and security groups, add the managed rules `s3-bucket-public-read-prohibited` and `restricted-ssh`, create a security group allowing SSH from 0.0.0.0/0 and watch it become noncompliant. Cost warning: Config bills per configuration item recorded and per rule evaluation, so limit the resource types and delete the recorder and rules when done.",
